port multimedia/libdvdcss
type port
reason "DragonFly: no SCSI pass-through for 1.5.0's CPRM ioctls"

# dragonfly/@2026Q3, @2026Q4: 1.5.0 adds ioctl_ReadCPRMMediaId and
# ioctl_ReadCPRMMKBPack, implemented with Linux SG, FreeBSD's
# cam/scsi/scsi_sg.h (files/patch-src-ioctl.c), Windows and macOS, and
# "#error DVD ioctls are unavailable" otherwise. DragonFly has none of those
# pass-throughs; make the two calls fail, so CPRM discs are refused while CSS
# keeps working. main has 1.6.0.
